config BR2_PACKAGE_SOPHGO_ION
	bool "sophgo-ion (ION allocator for the Sophgo multimedia stack)"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  The vendor ION memory allocator of the Sophgo 5.10 kernel
	  (drivers/staging/android/ion), which mainline removed in 5.11,
	  built out of tree for Linux 7.2 as cvi_ion.ko: /dev/ion, the
	  carveout heap over the "ion" reserved-memory region, and the
	  cvi_ion_* API of the Sophgo osdrv modules.  F7, see
	  docs/multimedia.md.

comment "sophgo-ion needs a Linux kernel"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
